# nicolae_tomb_entry_unfolded_pyramid_diagonal is a source-authored tomb_entry map. Its MAP is unchanged; named Lua hooks replace source script lines at their original positions.
NAME: nicolae_tomb_entry_unfolded_pyramid_diagonal
ORIENT: float
TAGS: tomb_entry no_monster_gen no_item_gen transparent
NSUBST: C = 1:. / *:c
KMONS: 1 = mummy
KMONS: O = guardian mummy
KFEAT: O = enter_tomb
MAP
       .....
      ...c...
     ...ccc...
    ...cc.cc...
   .1.cc...cc.1.
  ...cc..1..cc...
 ...cc+ccccc+cc...
...cc.cC...Cc.cc...
..cc..c.1.1.c..cc..
.++..1c..O..c1..cc.
..cc..c.1.1.c..cc..
...cc.cC...Cc.cc...
 ...cc+ccccc+cc...
  ...cc..1..cc...
   .1.cc...cc.1.
    ...cc.cc...
     ...ccc...
      ...c...
       .....
ENDMAP
